## What to look for (beyond the linters)

- Input validation and authorization on new entry points.
- Error handling that hides failures instead of surfacing them.
- Tests that assert behaviour, not implementation details.
- Secrets or machine-specific paths in the diff.
- Migrations or configuration changes that need a rollout plan.

